/// `TakeRandom(n, rng)` = `UnstableShuffle(rng).Take(n)` — the rares (collected
/// in draw-pile order) are shuffled off the `CombatCardSelection` stream and the
/// first `count` are taken (so when there are more rares than free slots, the
/// kept subset AND its hand order are RNG-determined). v0.103.2 instead moved
/// ALL rares unconditionally (the prior port). The `card_rarity_for_id` helper
